text: >-
  From:

  Sent: Wednesday, December 10, 2025 11:23 AM

  To: Candace Tips <tips@candaceowens.com>

  Subject: Flights -Fort Huachuca Sept 9. 2025

  Keep up the good work and be safe!!!

  Just wanted to bring to your attention that on 9/8/25, a US Government plane,
  SAM (Special Air Mission) caught my eye. This is what I found about that
  particular plane that is based out of

  Andrews Air force base shown as Camp Springs (ADW) below. U.S. Air Force C-37A
  Gulfstream V VIP jet, part a unit that caters to senior members of the
  executive branch and Congress.

  Plane # is 99-0404. As you'll see on the screenshot below, on Sept 7th the
  plane flew from Andrews to Colorado Springs. On Sept 8th it flew from Colorado
  Springs to Tucson then, 5 hrs later

  flew from Tucson and then transponder appears to be turned off. However, at
  12:31 pm on September 9th, it flies from FORT HUACHUCA to El Paso and then El
  Paso back to Andrews.

  This is the ONLY time I've noticed this plane be in Fort Huachuca. If your
  contact you mentioned yesterday saw this group of men in the morning, it could
  line up well with this aircraft leaving

  at 11:43am on the 9th!

  From other searches I've done, it appears Pam Bondi flew on this plane
  approximately 5 months ago from Tampa area back to DC.

  I am looking into other flights. Please be safe and God Bless!
